     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">Dear lavaan members,</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">I have a multi-level example where I expect the relationship between two individual-level variables to be moderated by a group-level variable (one that varies only between-groups). Can I test this hypothesis using lavaan?</span><br><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">in Mplus would be somethig like:</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">WTIHIN = x;</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">BETWEEN = w;</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">MODEL:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">%WITHIN%</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">s | y ON x;</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">%BETWEEN%</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">s ON w;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, Arial, Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">My major problem is how to define in lavaan &quot;s&quot;....</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">is that even possible?</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">Thanks!</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Arial,Helvetica;font-size:12.8px\">Borja</span></div></div>"
    ]
